<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37874" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαιγίζω</span></b> , (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>rush upon,</i> twice in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> of a stormy wind, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζέφυρος . . λάβρος ἐπαιγίζων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.148
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρον . . λάβρον ἐπαιγίζοντα δι᾽
					αἰθέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.293
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάβρως ἐ. ὁ βορρᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.42
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἔρως λάβρον ἐπαιγίζων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.285
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.): c. dat., <i>rush over,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαιγίζει πεδίοισι,</span> of a stream
			that has burst its banks, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.125
			</span></i>: c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντον
			ἐπαιγίζει,</span> of the dolphin, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.583
			</span></i>.</div>
